# For backend/logic devs
- Used FormGroup to store the data
- Once user enters a username or password and clicks sign in the data is stored in a JSON structure an example is provided below of how it would look like the same also goes for the register page
    {
        username: "john123",
        password: "password123"
    }
- I printed out the data into the console log so you can see how it looks
- The names for the form groups are in the .ts files for the register and login components